<title>USA: COREStaff buys California staffing firm.</title>
<headline>COREStaff buys California staffing firm.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>COREStaff Inc said Friday that it had acquired substantially all of the assets of Roberta Enterprises Inc, a California-based general staffing services company with 1996 revenues of about $36 million.</p>
<p>COREStaff said the acquisition would have a positive impact on 1997 earnings. The company did not reveal terms of the cash deal.</p>
